<!-- Multiverse's addon icons: FTL Archipelago shows its own, lit while connected (mvaddon.lua). Art by Trapper444. -->
<event name="ADDON_FTL_ARCHIPELAGO">
	<hover-text>FTL ARCHIPELAGO
	Click to see more info.</hover-text>
	<text>FTL ARCHIPELAGO
	Developed by: Liloji. Art by Trapper444.

	Your ships, systems and weapons are spread across an Archipelago multiworld. The icon is lit while the game is connected to the server, and dark when it is not.

	Press TAB, or the Archipelago button in the top right corner, to open the dashboard.</text>
</event>
